# Era Widgets

- Canonical API is **HTML + `ew-*` classes + `data-*`**, not React props.
- Set personality with `data-era` on a root (deco|earth|groovy|mcm-atomic|memphis|neon|neutral). Do not rewrite markup per era.
- Zero attributes = defaults. Prefer native `<button>`, `<dialog>`, `<input>`.
- Tabs: `<ew-tabs>` + `@era-widgets/elements/ew-tabs.js` for APG keyboard.
- CSS: link `@era-widgets/css/era-widgets.css` (published CSS must not use at-import).
- Glow never counts as contrast; no display faces on controls.
- MCP `validate` returns exact "change X to Y" fixes.
- Heroes: alert, avatar, breadcrumb, button, card, checkbox, dialog, icon-button, link, menu, ornament-divider, popover, radio, select, slider, switch, tabs, text-field, textarea, toast, tooltip. Eras: deco (~35), earth (~30), groovy (~40), mcm-atomic (~40), memphis (~50), neon (~55), neutral (~0).
